Host shim: n1 select -> iselect, in every file that names it.

The name collides with select(2).  COHERENT 3.2 has no select, so the native
source keeps the plain name.  build-cc.sh additionally asserts that no
occurrence survives: a NEW reference added upstream would leave this patch
applying cleanly while the build silently called the libc function.

